  _glyph: 
  _subtitle: Chapter 2
  _description: '[[74be2f99-978f-4a21-9eca-fc675e81362d|Dorothy Gale]] wakes up in
    the land of the Munchkins. The [[126d0495-5f1a-42dc-952a-bf6c9e2c9595|Good Witch
    of the North]] sends her to the Wizard and gives her the [[3cbd0685-ef92-4b23-a0b9-dac72c467ecb|Silver
    Shoes]].'
